attempts.raw:
@start **The window opens on a single spine column.** Column 0, `ymdA`, is carried by 100% of chromosomes, persistent, in a region of plasticity in 0% of calls {S1}. The model names 99% of them, at 0.44 bits {S1, M}.

@variable **The rest of the window is fork and variable columns**, 1 to 79, carried by 39 to 89%, in a region of plasticity in 0.2 to 69% of calls {S2}. The `csg` genes, columns 1 to 7, are [[curli assembly and transport]], and the `rut` genes, columns 26 to 33, are [[pyrimidine utilization]] {S2.c1-7, S2.c26-33, Q}. A branch of 55 families runs through columns 1 to 55 in 10 to 11%, `ymdB` to `ptsG` {S2.b1}.

@model **The model names more genes on the spine column than on the fork and variable ones**, 99 against 92%, and hesitates less there, 0.44 against 0.52 bits {M}. It hesitates most at column 12, `ycdU`, a fork column, 2.22 bits {H}.

@end **The window ends on fork columns.** Column 79, `yccS`, is carried by 45% of chromosomes {S2.c79, E}. A branch of 4 families runs through columns 76 to 79 in 21 to 28%, `ompA` to `fabA` {S2.b76}.

@whole **Across the window it names 92% of genes**, 0.52 bits on average, perplexity 1.6 families {G}. Inside a region of plasticity it hesitates more than outside, 1.45 against 0.21 bits, and names fewer genes, 75% against 97% {C}.

